F\"> 'Yes'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> :</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\"> 'No'} (demo, nothing is sent)`</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> :</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\"> 'Pick a side'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">      &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">p</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">div</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">  )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">}</span></span></code></pre>","usageRaw":"import { useState } from 'react'\nimport { PredictionMarketBar, type MarketSide } from '@/components/prediction-market-bar'\n\nexport default function PredictionMarketBarDemo() {\n  const [last, setLast] = useState<MarketSide | null>(null)\n  return (\n    <div className=\"flex w-[min(94vw,420px)] flex-col gap-3\">\n      <PredictionMarketBar question=\"Will ETH close above $4,000 on Dec 31?\" yes={0.62} volume=\"$1.2M\" closes=\"Closes Dec 31\" onTrade={setLast} />\n      <p className=\"text-center text-xs text-muted-foreground\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n        {last ? `You picked ${last === 'yes' ? 'Yes' : 'No'} (demo, nothing is sent)` : 'Pick a side'}\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n","variants":[]}